# SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0 AND CC0-1.0
#
# Minimal SHACL shape for the runtime smoke test (#78). Not the DCAT-AP.de shapes:
# those are AGPL-3.0 and never part of this repository or the image (NOTICE.md).
#
# It exists for two reasons. The container's readiness check is CRITICAL while the
# configured shapes directory holds no *.ttl, so without a shape the container never
# becomes ready. And it gives the smoke test a rule that only SHACL enforces - the
# EMF model knows no title length limit - so a 422 on the over-long title proves that
# the shapes were loaded and are enforced on write.
#
# Generated with the assistance of AI (Anthropic Claude); reviewed by a project
# committer before merge.

@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dct:  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix ex:   <urn:dcat-atlas:runtime-smoke#> .

ex:CatalogTitleShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass dcat:Catalog ;
    sh:property [
        sh:path dct:title ;
        sh:maxLength 40 ;
        sh:message "runtime smoke test: catalog title longer than 40 characters"
    ] .
